<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Decoy Radar -->
  <DMS_DecoyRadar.label>诱饵雷达</DMS_DecoyRadar.label>
  <!-- EN: A phase array radar. Once activated, it puts out a powerful wave radiation signal which will attract a feral automatroid to attack along with its escorts. If you can defeat it, you can collect the advanced technology from its corpse. The signal pulse burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once. -->
  <DMS_DecoyRadar.description>一种相控阵雷达。当被启用时，它会发出强大的毫米波辐射信号，吸引重型机兵与护卫队一起攻击。如果你能打败它，你可以从它的屍体上收集特殊技术。信号脉冲会烧坏发射器，所以这座建筑只能使用一次。</DMS_DecoyRadar.description>
  <!-- EN: Attract tarbosaurus threat -->
  <DMS_DecoyRadar.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>吸引骇蜥袭击</DMS_DecoyRadar.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: Decoy Antenna -->
  <DMS_DecoyRadio.label>诱饵天线</DMS_DecoyRadio.label>
  <!-- EN: A modified signal transponder which is rigged to send a high power burst transmission. Once activated it puts out a powerful decoy signal which will attract a feral group of automatroid forces to attack your colony. If you can defeat them, you can collect the advanced technology from their corpses. The signal pulse burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once. -->
  <DMS_DecoyRadio.description>经过改装的信号转发器。启动後，它会发出强大的诱饵信号，吸引重型机兵部队前来攻击。如果你能打败它，你可以从它的屍体上收集特殊技术。信号脉冲会烧坏发射器，所以这座建筑只能使用一次。</DMS_DecoyRadio.description>
  <!-- EN: Attract geochelone threat -->
  <DMS_DecoyRadio.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>吸引象龟袭击</DMS_DecoyRadio.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  


  
  <!-- EN: Decoy radio -->
  <DMS_DecoyTransmitter.label>诱导基站</DMS_DecoyTransmitter.label>
  <!-- EN: A high-powered radio, used fake radio signals to lure away the automated defense systems that still exist on the planet. Once activated, it puts out a powerful wave radiation signal which will attract ultra heavy automatroid to attack along with its escorts. If you can defeat it, you can collect the advanced technology from its corpse. The signal pulse burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once. -->
  <DMS_DecoyTransmitter.description>一台高功率无线电装置，利用伪造的无线电讯号引诱星球上残存的自动防御系统。一旦启动，它会发出强大的辐射波讯号，吸引超重型机兵及其护卫前来攻击。如果你能击败它，就能从它的残骸中获得先进技术。讯号脉冲会烧毁发射器，因此只能使用一次。</DMS_DecoyTransmitter.description>
  <!-- EN: Attract cluster weaver threat -->
  <DMS_DecoyTransmitter.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>吸引集群织鸟袭击</DMS_DecoyTransmitter.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>

</LanguageData>